eating pasta and drinking wine everywhere,

01:15:29.510 --> 01:15:31.190
then I'm going to drink wine everywhere.

01:15:31.190 --> 01:15:33.110
It's not a big deal to me.

01:15:33.110 --> 01:15:36.550
But as it stands right now, I have cut back
very substantially.

