01:25:53.310 --> 01:26:01.540
That's a success in terms of new skills, new
relationships or deepened relationships, and

01:26:01.540 --> 01:26:04.080
also just energy.

01:26:04.080 --> 01:26:07.810
Which of these will give me the most energy,
will I be most energized by?

01:26:07.810 --> 01:26:10.140
So I'll repeat that.

01:26:10.140 --> 01:26:12.310
Three options, having trouble choosing between
them.

01:26:12.310 --> 01:26:14.770
Let's just say they're creative projects.

01:26:14.770 --> 01:26:18.500
Which of these can be a success for me, even
if it fails?

01:26:18.500 --> 01:26:22.520
Let's say the launch doesn't work, people
don't want to buy it, whatever it is.

01:26:22.520 --> 01:26:29.890
In terms of new skills or directing old skills,
in the case of me choosing my new absurd art

01:26:29.890 --> 01:26:32.420
project, as a resurrecting old skills.

01:26:32.420 --> 01:26:39.840
So resurrecting old skills or developing new
skills, developing new relationships, or deepening

01:26:39.840 --> 01:26:44.370
current relationship, and then providing life
energy, energizing you.

01:26:44.370 --> 01:26:48.710
That is how I've decided to spend so much
